  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W45",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周标准高分环境占比最高的仍然是勇得神器牺牲（上周北京MS胜率在主流套牌中也最高），达到15.5%，但本周的胜率只有49.2%。蓝黑中速占比第二，却只拿下三个八强席位。相比之下红白龙、蓝白模模和黑白回血的本周胜率都在57%以上。",
          "en": "Jund Artifact Sacrifice still led the Standard high-score metagame at 15.5%. It also had the highest win rate among the major decks at last week’s Magic Spotlight in Beijing, but it won only 49.2% of its matches this week. Dimir Midrange was second by share and earned just three Top 8 spots. Boros Dragons, Azorius Momo, and Orzhov Lifegain all posted win rates above 57%."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "主牌满编索尔兽的白绿地落席卷三场，本周最多：deck:a5911431eecaec1fa7d2。思路本身前两周就已经出现，本周继续上升势头，索尔兽在现在的环境中确实可以看住不少套牌。不过整个白绿地落的周胜率是51.5%，并没有特别出彩。",
          "en": "Selesnya Landfall with four copies of [[card:Doorkeeper Thrull|Doorkeeper Thrull]] in the main deck won three events, the most of any build this week: deck:a5911431eecaec1fa7d2. The approach had already appeared over the previous two weeks and kept gaining ground. [[card:Doorkeeper Thrull|Doorkeeper Thrull]] checks quite a few decks in this metagame. The archetype as a whole posted a modest 51.5% win rate for the week."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:a5911431eecaec1fa7d2",
            "label": {
              "zh": "白绿地落 · KillTheDrake · 第1名",
              "en": "Selesnya Landfall · KillTheDrake · Rank 1"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "selesnya-landfall",
              "display_name": "Selesnya Landfall",
              "event_id": "12857702",
              "deck_id": "a5911431eecaec1fa7d2",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "bbe83c68e98b96cdc420a5cc07c81a3dd415ac6a20b7187ec6419672196edf7c",
              "player": "KillTheDrake",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "starttime": "2026-11-08 23:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "上周开始出现的蓝黑控制本周也拿下两个冠军、七个八强。大多数八强版本主牌满编[[card:Deadly Cover-Up|致命掩盖]]，但有一套席卷牌表完全不带：deck:af83e6abfe2bfa33bdd0。改为满编[[card:Theorix Charm|论析护符]]、[[card:Spell Snare|圈套咒语]]和[[card:Jace's Machinations|杰斯的阴谋]]，并带两张[[card:Spectral Interference|幽灵干预]]。相比常见版本，更偏节奏。个人看法蓝黑控在现在环境可以较好生存除了杰斯的强度之外，主要原因之一是[[card:Deadly Cover-Up|致命掩盖]]，所以并不太看好这个更低曲线的构筑方式。",
          "en": "Dimir Control started showing up last week and took two titles and seven Top 8 spots this week. Most of those Top 8 lists ran four copies of [[card:Deadly Cover-Up|Deadly Cover-Up]] in the main deck, but one winning list left the card out entirely: deck:af83e6abfe2bfa33bdd0. It plays four each of [[card:Theorix Charm|Theorix Charm]], [[card:Spell Snare|Spell Snare]], and [[card:Jace's Machinations|Jace's Machinations]], along with two [[card:Spectral Interference|Spectral Interference]]. That puts it closer to a tempo deck than the usual build. In my view, [[card:Deadly Cover-Up|Deadly Cover-Up]] is a big part of why Dimir Control holds up in this field alongside Jace, so I’m less optimistic about this lower-curve version."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:af83e6abfe2bfa33bdd0",
            "label": {
              "zh": "蓝黑控制 · yamipino · 第1名",
              "en": "Dimir Control · yamipino · Rank 1"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "dimir-control",
              "display_name": "Dimir Control",
              "event_id": "12857666",
              "deck_id": "af83e6abfe2bfa33bdd0",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "fb3b471572a86a702b7a186b447c92aa4d73f47cc3ceff82b64b6bf0c7652c4d",
              "player": "yamipino",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "starttime": "2026-11-05 11:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "text": {
          "zh": "还有一套艾斯波高防拿下四强：deck:271f82924e5f29ceef9e。套牌核心思路是大量0/X的高防生物配合杜兰效应（按防御力而非力量来分配伤害）单卡，FRA带来了[[card:Ghalta the Immovable|难撼戈厄塔]]，算上MSH的[[card:The Kingpin of Crime|犯罪大王金并]]，现在环境里有8张这个效应。还重印了哲子可以给所有0、1攻生物穿透，只要站住杜兰生物打的会非常快。但相应地，如果没有这个效应，大多数生物就是纯墙。所以套牌也带了6个[[card:Dive Down|深潜]]来保护。强度不太好说，但构筑逻辑还是非常自洽的。",
          "en": "Esper Toughness also made the Top 4: deck:271f82924e5f29ceef9e. The deck pairs a pile of high-toughness 0/X creatures with Doran-style effects that let them assign combat damage using toughness. Reality Fracture added [[card:Ghalta the Immovable|Ghalta the Immovable]], giving the list eight copies of the effect alongside [[card:The Kingpin of Crime|The Kingpin of Crime]] from Marvel Super Heroes. The set also reprinted [[card:Tetsuko Umezawa, Fugitive|Tetsuko Umezawa, Fugitive]], which lets creatures with 0 or 1 power slip through unblocked. If a Doran effect sticks, the deck can close games fast. Without one, most of its creatures are just walls, so the list packs six [[card:Dive Down|Dive Down]] effects for protection. Its power level is hard to call, but the pieces fit together."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:271f82924e5f29ceef9e",
            "label": {
              "zh": "艾斯波高防 · walshi4life · 第4名",
              "en": "Esper Toughness · walshi4life · Rank 4"
            },
            "deck": {
